        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>While 7 is considered great, 6 is often considered the best.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Depends on who you talk to, but yes, 6 is pretty amazing and also has a great intro sequence. For me though, Chrono Trigger still blows everything else out of the water.</p>",
