        "created_at": "2015-06-19T01:55:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Back on the subject at hand, was FF7 the best of the FFs for people who played through them all/most of them?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I find IV to be my personal favorite. I have only beated IV, VII, and X. Though I have played all of them up to X and also played XIII.&nbsp;</p>",
