        "created_at": "2015-06-19T04:14:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In my opinion, VI was the best Final Fantasy, followed very closely by the original Final Fantasy Tactics and Chrono Trigger. I haven't played IV all the way through (slacking, I know), but it seems like it is nearly in that tier. VII is not. It is a good game, and one I enjoyed greatly, but not even remotely the best of the series.</p>",
