        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-06-19T13:58:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I honestly don't care which was the \"best\". I had a great time with VII back in the day, and I'm enjoying the hell out of it now.</p>",
